{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Also El</b>: Because he is held back before HaShem, therefore he said: 'HaShem will cut him off and uproot him from His tent.'" "<b>And your root from the land of the living, selah</b>: As you uprooted the house of Ahimelech." "<b>Selah</b>: In truth, as a form of prayer, or in the Holy Spirit."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 52, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:40.681177136Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}